# What goes into the .vsix (P13, AD-P13-01/02): only the built extension, its manifest and its documents.
# Everything is bundled into dist/, so no node_modules and no source. Source maps stay in dist/ for debugging, never shipped.
# (vsce applies the "!" lines after the ignore lines, so the includes below name what is wanted instead of "!dist/**".)
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!ThirdPartyNotices.txt
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!dist/build-info.json
!dist/host/extension.js
!dist/host/pagemd/**
!dist/webview/main.js
!dist/webview/codicons/**
!dist/webview/mermaid/**
!dist/webview/monaco/**
!dist/defaults/**
**/*.map
